      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "seed": 92003, "roundness": null,
      "text": "1.  Creation  -  user starts a program; OS loads code into memory and assigns CPU + resources.",
